Vendored codec source
=====================

The .cs files under Erasure16/ and LdpcStaircase/ in this directory are verbatim
copies of the reference implementations of two standalone, application-independent
codec projects. Their upstream copyright and attribution notices follow.

The normative specifications these implement are vendored separately, with their own
notice, under protocol/1.0/codecs/.

